# AI-AGENT NOTICE: Scheduled-only interface. Use only when
# control_modes.<mode>.inference.scheduler.enable=true. Do not use on the legacy inference path.
# Goal: Close a product inference session.
# session_generation==0 is reserved for uncertain-Open cleanup. Global resolves it
# to the recorded generation when known; pipeline binds 0 to its current fence.
# drained_generation is the higher fencing gen published after full drain.
string<=36 session_id
uint64 session_generation
builtin_interfaces/Time deadline
---
# Result
bool success
string<=36 session_id
string<=63 pipeline_id
uint64 closed_session_generation
uint64 drained_generation
ibrobot_msgs/InferenceOutcome outcome
ibrobot_msgs/ScheduledInferenceError error
---
# Feedback (not used for correctness)
string<=128 status
